   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "CTIS public API: euclinicaltrials.eu/ctis-public-api. Unofficial, undocumented, no auth. Fields as seen in real responses on 2026-10-31.\n* = a field TrialWatch relies on. Types: str, int, bool, list, obj; date = 'YYYY-MM-DD', ts = ISO timestamp. -> ref.x = code decoded by that table in db.excalidraw.\nCTIS timestamps carry no time zone (e.g. 2026-08-14T03:37:46.157584519) and the API does not say which one; confirm before converting them to UTC.",
   "originalText": "CTIS public API: euclinicaltrials.eu/ctis-public-api. Unofficial, undocumented, no auth. Fields as seen in real responses on 2026-10-31.\n* = a field TrialWatch relies on. Types: str, int, bool, list, obj; date = 'YYYY-MM-DD', ts = ISO timestamp. -> ref.x = code decoded by that table in db.excalidraw.\nCTIS timestamps carry no time zone (e.g. 2026-08-14T03:37:46.157584519) and the API does not say which one; confirm before converting them to UTC.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
