   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "* ctNumber                      str   EU CT number\n* ctStatus                      str   overall status as text, e.g. Ended\n* ctPublicStatusCode            int   same status -> ref.trial_status\n  trialRegionCode               int   -> ref.trial_region\n  decisionDate                  ts    first authorisation decision\n* endDateEU                     date  trial ended in the EU/EEA\n  publishDate                   ts    when CTIS published this version\n\n  events                        obj   \n*   trialGlobalEndDate          date  ended everywhere: results due +1 yr\n*   trialEvents[]               list  per country: early end, halts\n      .earlyTerminationReason   obj   code -> ref.early_termination_reason\n\n  results                       obj   \n*   summaryResults[]            list  technical results summary posted\n*   laypersonResults[]          list  plain-language summary posted\n*     .submissionDate           ts    when it was submitted\n      .versionType              str   Final | Interim\n\n  documents[]                   list  every published file:\n*   uuid                        str   id for /documents download\n*   documentType                str   -> ref.document_type (103, 46)\n    title, fileType             str   file name; usually PDF\n\n  authorizedApplication         obj   the authorised trial itself:\n    memberStatesConcerned[]     list  countries: mscName, status\n    authorizedPartI             obj   the part shared by all countries:\n      .clinicalTrialIdentifiers obj   titles: full, public, short\n      .trialCategory.trialPhase str   -> ref.trial_phase\n      .trialDuration            obj   estimated start and end dates\n      .ageRanges[]              list  -> ref.age_group\n      .sponsors[].organisation  obj   name, typeCode -> ref.sponsor_type\n      .products[]               list  medicines and their role\n    authorizedPartsII[]         list  per country: sites, status history",
   "originalText": "* ctNumber                      str   EU CT number\n* ctStatus                      str   overall status as text, e.g. Ended\n* ctPublicStatusCode            int   same status -> ref.trial_status\n  trialRegionCode               int   -> ref.trial_region\n  decisionDate                  ts    first authorisation decision\n* endDateEU                     date  trial ended in the EU/EEA\n  publishDate                   ts    when CTIS published this version\n\n  events                        obj   \n*   trialGlobalEndDate          date  ended everywhere: results due +1 yr\n*   trialEvents[]               list  per country: early end, halts\n      .earlyTerminationReason   obj   code -> ref.early_termination_reason\n\n  results                       obj   \n*   summaryResults[]            list  technical results summary posted\n*   laypersonResults[]          list  plain-language summary posted\n*     .submissionDate           ts    when it was submitted\n      .versionType              str   Final | Interim\n\n  documents[]                   list  every published file:\n*   uuid                        str   id for /documents download\n*   documentType                str   -> ref.document_type (103, 46)\n    title, fileType             str   file name; usually PDF\n\n  authorizedApplication         obj   the authorised trial itself:\n    memberStatesConcerned[]     list  countries: mscName, status\n    authorizedPartI             obj   the part shared by all countries:\n      .clinicalTrialIdentifiers obj   titles: full, public, short\n      .trialCategory.trialPhase str   -> ref.trial_phase\n      .trialDuration            obj   estimated start and end dates\n      .ageRanges[]              list  -> ref.age_group\n      .sponsors[].organisation  obj   name, typeCode -> ref.sponsor_type\n      .products[]               list  medicines and their role\n    authorizedPartsII[]         list  per country: sites, status history",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
